# Privacy Policy for Just Timer

**Last updated: September 30, 2026**

Just Timer is designed to be a simple and privacy-friendly timer application.

Your privacy is important to us. Just Timer does not require you to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share your personal information.

## Information We Collect

Just Timer does not collect personal data.

We do not collect information such as:

- Your name
- Email address
- Phone number
- Location
- Contacts
- Photos
- Browsing activity
- Advertising identifiers
- Usage history
- Device identifiers

We do not use tracking technologies to follow your activity across other apps or websites.

## Information Stored on Your Device

Just Timer may store information required for the operation of the app locally on your device, such as:

- Timer settings
- Number of rounds
- Round and rest durations
- Saved timer presets
- Selected sounds
- App preferences

This information remains on your device and is not transmitted to us.

Removing the app from your device will normally remove locally stored Just Timer data associated with the app.

## Notifications

Just Timer may use local notifications or system alerts to inform you when a timer, round, or rest period has completed.

These notifications are generated on your device. Notification permissions are managed through iOS Settings.

Just Timer does not use notification permission to collect personal information.

## Analytics and Tracking

Just Timer currently does not use third-party analytics, advertising trackers, or behavioral tracking services.

We do not sell personal information and we do not use your information for targeted advertising.

## Advertising

Just Timer currently does not include third-party advertising.

If advertising is introduced in a future version, this Privacy Policy will be updated to explain what information, if any, is processed by advertising providers and what privacy choices are available to you.

## Purchases and Premium Features

Just Timer may offer optional premium features or in-app purchases in the future.

Purchases made through the App Store are processed by Apple under Apple's own terms and privacy policies.

Just Timer does not receive or store your full payment card or banking information.

If purchase-related functionality is introduced, the app may receive information from Apple necessary to determine whether you are entitled to premium features.

## Third-Party Services

Just Timer relies on Apple and iOS services necessary to distribute and operate the application.

Information processed directly by Apple is governed by Apple's own privacy policies and terms.

Just Timer does not currently integrate third-party advertising or analytics SDKs.

## Data Retention and Deletion

Because Just Timer does not collect or maintain personal information on our servers, there is normally no personal information for us to retain or delete.

Information stored locally by the app can be removed by deleting the app from your device.

If future versions introduce services that store user information remotely, this policy will be updated with details about data retention and deletion.

## Children's Privacy

Just Timer does not knowingly collect personal information from children or other users.

Because the app does not require an account and does not collect personal information, no personal profiles are created for children.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy if Just Timer's features, services, or data practices change.

Any updated version will be published on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.

If a future update introduces functionality such as advertising, analytics, cloud synchronization, accounts, or other features involving data processing, this Privacy Policy will be updated accordingly.

